  "about": "The Town list. The main channel `general` comes first whenever it is known, pinned or not (it can't be unpinned). Then pins: everyone's (channel-order \"pinned\", in its order), then mine (belfry:pins), deduplicated, ids not in `known` skipped. Then recent: channels in `known`, not pinned, where within the last 30 days (created_at > now - 30*86400) I posted (kind 9 or 1111 by me) or created the channel (kind 9007 by me), reacted (kind 7 by me) or was mentioned (a kind 9 or 1111 by someone else with [\"p\", me]); opening (seen) never counts. Recent are ordered by the channel's newest kind 9 / 1111 / 7 / 9007 by anyone (any age), newest first, ties by channel id ascending. The channel of an event is its first h tag.",
