 "replyAll": {
  "about": "Reply all, the only reply. Recipients: the sender (mail-from of the thread's latest received e-mail), then each [\"to\", address, name], then each [\"cc\", address, name] of that card, in tag order. Each address is trimmed and lowercased; an address whose domain is the belfry's domain or ends with \".\" + that domain is left out; duplicates keep the first; at most 20. To = the first recipient (the sender unless it was left out), Cc = the rest. rcptTo = all of them.",
